Package: postlinkaihelper
Type: Package
Title: AI-Powered Helpers for Post-Linkage Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Isabella", "Liu", email = "isabellaliu99@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides AI-assisted interpretation and reporting tools for the
    postlink package. Includes explain() for natural language interpretation of
    linkage-corrected model results, and generate_report() for producing
    formatted analysis reports. Supports multiple LLM providers (OpenAI,
    Anthropic, Google Gemini, Ollama) and output formats (Markdown, HTML,
    Quarto, Quarto manuscript). Also includes preflight_check() for
    linkage-specific data quality diagnostics before model fitting.
